{"id":"accidentellement","lemma":"accidentellement","pos":"adv","rank":4197,"glosses":["accidentally (unexpectedly, unintentionally)"],"ipa":"/ak.si.dɑ̃.tɛl.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/1c/Fr-accidentellement.ogg/Fr-accidentellement.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Le coup est parti accidentellement.","en":"The gun went off by accident.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"blow, hit"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"to go away","l":"partir"},null]},{"text":"Ça s'est produit complètement accidentellement.","en":"It happened completely by accident.","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"product"},{"g":"completely"},null]},{"text":"Elle a accidentellement déchiré la page.","en":"She accidentally tore the page.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"to tear","l":"déchirer"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"page"}]},{"text":"Je l'ai rencontrée accidentellement.","en":"I met her by accident.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},null,null]},{"text":"Il a accidentellement bu du détergeant.","en":"He drank detergent by accident.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"to drink","l":"boire"},{"g":"of the / some"},null]}]}